rapment:</strong></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1124]\" style=\"padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>3.7% after </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>C/S, </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pfannenstiel</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> incision.</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1125]\" style=\"padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">-</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>Pain Persis</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>t</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'> beyond </span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>5 weeks \u2013 Gabapenti</span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'>n, Amitriptyline</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1126]\" style=\"padding-left: 36pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\u2192</span><span class=\"mm-list-body\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Aptos\", sans-serif; font-size: 12pt'><strong>Psychological factors:</strong></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mm-para mm-list-item\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[1127]\" style=\"padding-left: 54pt\"><span class=\"mm-list-marker\" aria-hidden=